      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارتتق</span></b>  <i>It was,</i> or <i>became, closed up,</i> (S, Msb,
K,) [and <i>repaired;</i> and <i>sewed up,</i> or <i>together;</i>]
said of a rent: (S, Msb:) and also of the vulva
of a woman. (S, * TA.)

